        "subject": "Safety, Health and Environment",
        "chapter": "Process Safety, Risk Assessment, and Hazard analysis",
        "topic": "Fault and Event Tree Analysis",
        "subtopic": "Overview",
        "content_html": "<p>Fault Tree Analysis (FTA) is a systematic, graphical method used to analyze and assess the causes of system or process failures. </p>",
        "important": "",
