        "discipline": "Civil",
        "subject": "Ethics and Professional Practice",
        "chapter": "Licensure",
        "topic": "Licensure",
        "subtopic": "Overview",
        "content_html": "<h5><span><b>Benefits of Licensure:</b></span></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Career Enhancement and Progression:</li>\r\n<li>Title</li>\r\n<li>Flexibility of Working in different states of US</li>\r\n<li>Authority</li>\r\n<li>Higher Salary</li>\r\n<li>Prestige</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>To know more about the licensure process, please visit the \"Magazine\" section from top menu and go through various articles posted there.</p>",
        "important": "",
        "resources": "<div class=\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><div class=\"w-full mt-2\"><div style=\"padding:73.83% 0 0 0;position:relative;\"><iframe src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/586143545?h=95922a45a4&amp;badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;\" title=\"About FE Exam\"></iframe></div><script src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js\"></script></div></div>",
