        "subtopic": "Overview",
        "content_html": "R-L circuit:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Current lag behind voltage </li>\r\n<li>Power factor is lagging</li>\r\n<li>Phase angle is  negative.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\nR-C circuit:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Current leads the voltage.</li>\r\n<li>Power factor is leading.</li>\r\n</ul>",
