        "content_html": "Channel Routing \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Simulate the movement of water through a channel </li>\r\n<li>Used to predict the magnitudes, volumes, and temporal patterns of the flow (often a flood wave) as it translates down a channel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\nTwo types of routing : \r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Hydrologic</li>\r\n<li>Hydraulic</li>\r\n</ol>",
