        "content_html": "<ul>\r\n<li>Grow microorganism on substrates such as rocks, sand or plastic</li>\r\n<li>Wastewater is spread over the substrate</li>\r\n<li>e.g. Trickling filters, rotating biological contractors</li>\r\n</ul>",
