        "content_html": "<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\dfrac{a}{\\sin A} = \\dfrac{b}{\\sin B} = \\dfrac{c}{\\sin C}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 37</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
