        "discipline": "Mechanical",
        "subject": "Thermodynamics",
        "chapter": "Laws of Thermodynamics",
        "topic": "Third Law of Thermodynamics",
        "subtopic": "Overview",
        "content_html": "<p>The Third Law of thermodynamics defines the absolute zero of entropy. The entropy of a pure crystalline substance at absolute zero temperature is zero.</p>",
