        "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <p>Brayton cyle has two isentropic and two isobaric processes.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Brayton_cycle.svg/1024px-Brayton_cycle.svg.png\" style=\"max-width: 90vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Brayton_cycle.svg/1024px-Brayton_cycle.svg.png\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_talk:Duk</a>, Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 Unported, via Wikimedia Commons</small></small></center><br/>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>",
