        "discipline": "Mechanical",
        "subject": "Mechanical Design and Analysis",
        "chapter": "Cycles and Processes",
        "topic": "Internal Combustion Engines",
        "subtopic": "Overview",
        "content_html": "<div class= \"container-fluid\">\r\n  <div class= \"row align-items-start\">\r\n   <div class=\"col col-lg-8\">\r\n   <p>Diesel cycle comprises of two isentropic processes, one constant pressure process and one constant volume process.</p>\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$r = \\dfrac{V_1}{V_2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 457</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$r_c = \\dfrac{V_3}{V_2}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 457</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\nEfficiency is given by:\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">$\\eta = 1 - \\dfrac{1}{r^{k - 1}} \\left[\\dfrac{r_c^k - 1}{k (r_c - 1}\\right]$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 457</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\nwhere, $k = \\dfrac{c_p}{c_v}$\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"col\">\r\n<center><p><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/Theoretical_Diesel_diagram.gif\" style=\"max-width: 50vh;\"></p><br/>\r\n<small><small><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Theoretical_Diesel_diagram.gif\">MyName (Armchoir)</a>, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons<br/></small></small></center>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Brake Power, $\\dot{W} = 2 \\pi T N = 2 \\pi FR N$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 457</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Indicated Power, $\\dot{W_i} = \\dot{W_b}  +\\dot{W_f} $ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 457</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Brake Thermal efficiency, $\\eta_b = \\dfrac{\\dot{W_b}}{\\dot{M_f} (HV)}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 458</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Indicated Thermal Efficiency, $\\eta_i = \\dfrac{\\dot{W_i}}{\\dot{M_f} (HV)}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 458</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Mechanical Efficiency, $\\eta_i = \\dfrac{\\dot{W_b}}{\\dot{W_i}} = \\dfrac{\\eta_b}{\\eta_i}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 458</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Displacement Volume, $V_d = \\dfrac{\\pi B^2S}{4}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 458</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Compression Ratio, $r_c = \\dfrac{V_t}{V_c}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 458</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Mean Effective Pressure, $mep = \\dfrac{\\dot{W}n_s}{V_dn_cN}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 459</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Volumetric Efficiency, $\\eta_v = \\dfrac{2\\dot{m_a}}{\\rho_aV_dn_cN}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 459</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center\">\r\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-light shadow-lg\">Specific Fuel Consumption (SFC) =$\\dfrac{\\dot{m_f}}{\\dot{W}} = \\dfrac{1}{\\eta HV}$ <span class=\"text-muted\">&emsp; &emsp; &emsp; Page 459</span></button>\r\n</div><br/>",
        "important": "\\[r = \\dfrac{V_1}{V_2}\\]\r\n\r\n\\[r_c = \\dfrac{V_3}{V_2}\\]\r\n\r\n\\[\\eta = 1 - \\dfrac{1}{r^{k - 1}} \\left[\\dfrac{r_c^k - 1}{k (r_c - 1}\\right]\\]",
