        "subtopic": "Buckingham's Pi Theorem",
        "content_html": "<p>This arranges the variables into a lesser number of dimensionless groups of variables. Because Buckingham used $\\pi$ (pi) to represent the product of variables in each groups, we call this method Buckingham pi theorem.</p>",
        "important": "",
        "resources": "",
