        "subtopic": "Overview",
        "content_html": "<ul>\r\n<li><b>Aliasing</b> happens when the waveform is sampled at low frequency.</li>\r\n<li>Aliasing can be avoided if sampling rate is at least twice the max frequency of the measured signal.</li>\r\n</ul>",
